    "detailed_description": "<h1>No Online Multiplayer</h1><p>PLEASE NOTE: <strong>1 Shot 1 Kill</strong> only supports <strong>local split screen multiplayer</strong> currently.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Dash, dodge, and take aim! A <strong>fresh take</strong> on arena shooters, where it only takes one shot to kill or be killed. <strong>1 Shot 1 Kill</strong> is a deadly third person arena combat shooter.<br><br>In the far reaches of space on the abandon mining planet Hyperion VI, the tyrant Adrik holds a combat tournament for his own entertainment and glory. In this sci-fi future, throwing knives have homing and light sabers are insanely fast, making them the preferred weapons for close quarter fighting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li><strong>1 Shot 1 Kill</strong>: One shot kills are the most satisfying<br>    </li><li><strong>Limited Ranged Ammo</strong>: You'll need to retrieve your thrown knives to reload. All shots have a significant amount of homing<br>    </li><li><strong>Unlimited Melee</strong>: Instant melee with a generous range and cool down<br>    </li><li><strong>Melee Reflect</strong>: You can reflect shots with your melee attack, light saber style<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/9a039eabde615a5c142aff9ad23d55ec.poster.avif?t=1740418167\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/9a039eabde615a5c142aff9ad23d55ec.webm?t=1740418167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/9a039eabde615a5c142aff9ad23d55ec.mp4?t=1740418167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>    </li><li><strong>Dash and Wall Jump</strong>: Every point on a map should be reachable via dashing or wall-jumps<br>    </li><li><strong>Dash Grab</strong>: You can grab shots out of the air while dashing<br>    </li><li><strong>Maximum Information</strong>: We tried to maximize player information and minimize hidden information. You can run, but you can't hide<br>    </li><li><strong>Three Game Modes</strong>: The Quest for Hyperion, The Battle Arena, and The Trials of Time</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Quest for Hyperion</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Survive waves of enemies solo or with friends<br>    </li><li>Battle over 12 stages of progressive danger, each with it's own unique <strong>boss fight</strong><br>    </li><li><strong>Split Screen Local Mode</strong>: Reviving the golden era of couch multiplayer<br>    </li><li>Epic Battlefields from the city of Catchfools to the Battleship Revenant<br>    </li><li>Warning! Friendly fire is always enabled</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/2500c0f9421c8154573efeaed0877305.poster.avif?t=1740418167\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/2500c0f9421c8154573efeaed0877305.webm?t=1740418167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/2500c0f9421c8154573efeaed0877305.mp4?t=1740418167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Battle Arena</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Play against your friends over a series of quick matches to determine the winner, often with a nail-biting ending<br>    </li><li><strong>Dynamic Game Balancing</strong>: Keeps competition fierce by buffing the underdogs of a tournament<br>    </li><li>Diverse power-ups and weapon types ensure no two matches are alike<br>    </li><li>A variety of power-ups and weapon types ensure that no two matches are ever the same<br>    </li><li>Best played with friends, on a couch, together in real life</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/6eda8eeb315542fe190b8f6048236dfb.poster.avif?t=1740418167\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/6eda8eeb315542fe190b8f6048236dfb.webm?t=1740418167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/6eda8eeb315542fe190b8f6048236dfb.mp4?t=1740418167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Trials of Time</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Hone your deadly reflexes in these challenging time trial scenarios<br>    </li><li>Master advanced techniques like <strong>rocket jumps</strong><br>    </li><li>Push your skills to the limit<br>    </li><li>Can you get 5 kills in under 2 seconds?</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/b3176874df3f260ff046d662bb5f167b.poster.avif?t=1740418167\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/b3176874df3f260ff046d662bb5f167b.webm?t=1740418167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830760/extras/b3176874df3f260ff046d662bb5f167b.mp4?t=1740418167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
